    question: 'What basis is the number?',
    answer: 'Port-to-port rows price the ocean or air leg only. All-in rows (Cogoport, DDP door-to-door) bundle origin charges, THC, clearance, duty/VAT and delivery — that is why the all-in column runs multiples above the port-to-port table.',
