  {
    q: 'How long does shipping from China to Oman take?',
    a: 'The route-data baseline is a typical 19 days to Sohar with a 15–30 day window (LOW confidence). The Ningbo origin row quotes 18–28 days, and LCL runs 25–35 days because consolidation adds handling. No verified Salalah-specific or China→Oman air transit figure is published in the snapshot — treat every window as indicative and confirm with the carrier.',
