    q: 'How should I quote transit time from China to Oman?',
    a: 'Quote 19 days port-to-port to Sohar as the baseline, then add discharge, Bayan clearance, 5% duty/VAT payment, any inspection and last-mile trucking to reach the door-to-door total. Ask the forwarder to split the port-to-port and door-to-door dates so the ocean leg is not mistaken for the delivery promise — on Oman’s thin lanes the gap between the two can run a week or more.',
