        China→Oman rows, all LOW confidence, sourced to a single aggregated forwarder table set
        (Junqing). That upgrade is useful, but read the label before the number: these rows are
        planning anchors built from 2024–2026 tables, not dated quotes from this month’s market.
        Gulf lanes have moved violently through 2026, so treat each range as a floor estimate.
      </p>

